- call `self.repo.diff(self.args.a_rev, self.args.b_rev)` positionally;
- remove each `hash` before either human or JSON output when `--show-hash` is false;
- log raw `json.dumps(diff)` for JSON;
- otherwise log `_show_diff(...)` only when nonempty;
- produce `"{}"` for an empty JSON diff and no human log for an empty diff.

